   101	 * out. Statement 2 runs after statement 1 commits its lock, under Postgres's own fresh
   102	 * READ-COMMITTED snapshot for the next statement — no application-level re-read is needed. A `mode=
   103	 * 'both'` ledger's wakeup is internal and is deliberately left untouched; a row with a LIVE claim is
   104	 * left for `recordWebhookAttempt`'s own fenced update to terminalize.
   105	 */
