   234	 * F8: `subjectId`/`payload.agent_id` here are placeholders only. The statement overrides both from
   235	 * `disabled_now.agent_id` (the token-fenced row's own agent), never from a caller-supplied argument
   236	 * that could name a different agent than the one the locked row actually disabled.
   237	 */
