   372	     SELECT ud.outcome FROM updated_delivery ud`;
   373	  // F2: statement 2 is a SEPARATE query in the same transaction, gated on a fresh read of
   374	  // `disabled_at` — it therefore covers a ledger row a concurrent enqueue committed DURING
   375	  // statement 1's own lock wait, which one shared snapshot could never see (round 2 finding 2).
