    29	 * deliver to; record it as a failed attempt so the store's own fenced update terminalizes it
    30	 * (`gone`/`disabled`) rather than rescheduling forever. F1: a `disabledAt` registration is the same
    31	 * case — never send another HTTP request after auto-disable, let the fenced update terminalize it.
