    98	 *
    99	 * Without the retention duty here the supported Vercel-only (cron-only) topology would accumulate
   100	 * every ledger indefinitely — the worker's timer is not available in degraded mode. Same reasoning
   101	 * for the wakeup maintenance: P3.3's runner frees a stuck one-inflight slot on a claim it completes,
   102	 * but a claim that crashed leaves its lease to expire, and only this sweep — worker or cron — ever
